The characteristic <polynomial> is
$$
(\lambda-3)(\lambda-2)^2.
$$
For $\lambda=2$, the eigenspace is spanned only by $(1,0,0)^T$, so its geometric multiplicity is one although its algebraic multiplicity is two. Hence $M$ is not diagonalisable.

